   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2019-10-31",
   "text": "SALT Deduction Fairness Act \n This bill increases the limitation on the deduction for state and local taxes to $20,000 for individuals filing a joint tax return. The limitation applies to taxable years 2018 through 2025."
  }
